        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents D07-K539-NET, Half Round Netropol Knob with Quaker Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Traditional Netropol Knobset is beautiful not because it is ornate, but rather, its simplicity is what makes it stand out. Sleek and elegant, the Half Round Netropol Knob with Quaker Plate is a great choice  for both contemporary and traditional homes. This latchset, made by Brass Accents, is available in a lot of different finishes ranging from classic to trendy; and no matter which one you choose, the Quaker Plate with Netropol Knob is sure to look wonderful.  It is adjustable for doors 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available with <a href= \"/products/quaker-solid-brass-latchset-brass-accents-d07-k539\"><b>More Knob and Lever Options</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Brass Accents D07-K539-NET Quaker Plate with Netropol Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of the door. It does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of the door. They do not latch and do not lock</b>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. The lock is activated by a push button while turning the inside knob releases the lock. It can be opened from the outside with a small tool.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Traditional Netropol Knobset, Brass Accents D07-K539-NET",
                "description": "Brass Accents D07-K539-NET, Traditional Netropol Knobset - The Traditional Netropol Knobset is beautiful not because it is ornate, but rather, its simplicity is what makes it stand out. Sleek and elegant, the Half Round Netropol Knob with Quaker Plate is a great choice  for both contemporary and traditional homes. This latchset, made by Brass Accents, is available in a lot of different finishes ranging from classic to trendy; and no matter which one you choose, the Quaker Plate with Netropol Knob is sure to look wonderful.  It is adjustable for doors 1-3/8 inches thick or 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n",
